                <text type="forecast">Mostly sunny. Winds south to southwesterly 15 to 20 km/h becoming light before dawn. Overnight temperatures falling to between 8 and 11 with daytime temperatures reaching the low 30s.</text>
            </forecast-period>
            <forecast-period index="3" start-time-local="2026-11-13T00:00:00+10:30" end-time-local="2026-11-14T00:00:00+10:30" start-time-utc="2026-11-12T13:30:00Z" end-time-utc="2026-11-13T13:30:00Z">
                <text type="forecast">Partly cloudy. High chance of showers, most likely in the morning and afternoon. The chance of a thunderstorm in the afternoon and evening. Light winds becoming north to northwesterly 15 to 20 km/h during the day then shifting southerly during the afternoon. Overnight temperatures falling to between 13 and 17 with daytime temperatures reaching the low 30s.</text>
            </forecast-period>
